<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Form Template</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
        .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .logo-area { text-align: center; }
        .contact-info { text-align: right; font-size: 12pt; }
        .form-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .signature-line { margin-top: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="logo-area">
            <svg width="50" height="50" viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <path d="M50 10 L70 30 L90 10 L70 -10 L50 -30 L30 -10 L10 10 L30 30 Z" fill="black"/>
            </svg>
            <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">UNIVERSITY OF</h1>
            <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">South Carolina</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="header-info">
            <div class="contact-info">
                <p>Bursar's Office</p>
                <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="address.city">{{ address.city }}</span>, <span data-field="address.state">{{ address.state }}</span> <span data-field="address.zip">{{ address.zip }}</span></p>
                <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
                <p>Email: <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">CHANGE TO TITLE IV FEE AUTHORIZATION STATEMENT</h2>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <div style="width: 30%;">
                    <p>Student Name (Print)</p>
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 20px;" data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 20%; text-align: center;">
                    <p>USC ID</p>
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 20px;" data-field="usc_id">{{ usc_id }}</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 20%; text-align: center;">
                    <p>VIP ID</p>
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 20px;" data-field="vip_id">{{ vip_id }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p><strong>Instructions:</strong></p>
            <p>This form is used to change the answer to the Title IV Fee Authorization Statement you submitted on Self-Service Carolina (SSC). If you wish to change your answer from what was submitted on SSC, complete this form and send it to the address or email address provided in the upper right.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Purpose of the Title IV Fee Authorization Statement</h3>
            <p>The U.S. Department of Education requires that Federal Title IV financial aid funds only be applied to towards allowable institutional charges such as tuition and fees, university housing and meal plans when applicable. However, with your authorization, the University can apply any Federal Title IV financial aid funds you receive to other non-institutional charges appearing on your student account.</p>
            <p>Example: If this authorization is not provided, charges such as a parking permit or health center charge would NOT be paid by your Title IV financial aid funds. You may need to pay these charges using other funds.</p>
            <p>Federal Title IV funds to which this statement applies include: Federal Pell Grant, Federal SEOG Grant, Federal TEACH Grant, Federal Perkins Loan, Federal Direct Subsidized Loan, Federal Direct Unsubsidized Loan and Graduate PLUS Loan.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; text-align: center;">TITLE IV FEE AUTHORIZATION STATEMENT</h3>
            <p>I authorize the University of South Carolina to apply any excess Title IV financial aid to non-institutional charges appearing on my student account for the academic year. I understand that this authorization is valid from the date of completion throughout my academic career at USC. I may rescind this authorization at any time.</p>
            <p>I wish to change my answer to the following:</p>
            <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                <input type="checkbox" id="agree" name="agree"><label for="agree"> Agree</label><br>
                <input type="checkbox" id="disagree" name="disagree"><label for="disagree"> Do Not Agree</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <p>By signing below I certify that I wish to change my answer to the Title IV Fee Authorization Statement to the answer checked above.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="signature-line">
            <div>
                <p>Signature of Student</p>
                <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 200px;" data-field="signature_of_student">{{ signature_of_student }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>Date</p>
                <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 150px;" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>